            <key> <string>description</string> </key>
            <value> <string encoding="cdata"><![CDATA[

Get step-by-step instructions for performing common ERP5 operations via MCP tools.\n
\n
    This tool does NOT modify any data - it returns a guided workflow to follow\n
    using the operational tools (erp5_create, erp5_read, erp5_write, erp5_action).\n
\n
    USE THIS WHEN:\n
    - You need to perform an ERP5 operation and want the correct sequence of tool calls.\n
    - The user asks "how do I create a Person/Organisation/Sale Order/etc. in ERP5?"\n
    - You want to discover all available tutorial guides.\n
\n
    USAGE:\n
    - tutorial="list" -> catalog of all available tutorials\n
    - tutorial="create_person" -> step-by-step guide for creating a Person\n
    - tutorial="create_person", name="John Doe" -> same guide with "John Doe" interpolated\n
    

]]></string> </value>
